#
# zzyd-sheng-audio-addon-mount.patch: the bind mount that puts this board's audio server plug-in
# (ShengAudio.driver, delivered in the gpu-addon payload input) next to the system's own HAL bundle. It is its own
# series rather than an append to patches/xnu/series because it must apply after the whole os: layer: its context
# is the tail of native_gpu_addon_prepare as zzy-native-gpu-addon-mount, zzy-staged-system-apps and
# zzyb-native-cryptex-os-view leave it, and the resolved order puts device:patches/xnu/series before os: (see the
# note there). The two series-usb patches that already run here touch other files.
#
zzyd-sheng-audio-addon-mount.patch
